# Sales Data Analysis (Python + Pandas)

This project analyzes sales data from a CSV file and visualizes total revenue per product.

## Files
- `sales_data.csv` — Sample dataset
- `data_analysis.py` — Analysis + bar chart
- `README.md` — Project info

## How to Run
```bash
pip install pandas matplotlib
python data_analysis.py
